  ('hanzi_yi_already', '已', '已', 'already part', 'bagian sudah', array['already part']::text[], array['bagian sudah']::text[], array[]::text[], array[]::text[], 'yǐ', 'yi3', '[{"hanzi":"已","text":"yǐ","tone":3}]'::jsonb, 3, '3', 'Half of *already* — alone it means nothing yet, needs 经 to become 已经. yǐ ≈ "ee" dipping. Tone 3 like something that happened a while back.', 'Setengah dari *sudah* — sendiri belum bermakna, butuh 经 untuk jadi 已经. yǐ ≈ "ee" turun terus naik. Nada 3 kayak sesuatu yang sudah terjadi.', null, null, null, array['[object Object]']::text[], 4, array['grammar', 'beginner']::text[], true),
