  ('hanzi_qi_weather', '气', '氣', 'air / energy', 'udara / energi', array['air / energy']::text[], array['udara / energi']::text[], array[]::text[], array[]::text[], 'qì', 'qi4', '[{"hanzi":"气","text":"qì","tone":4}]'::jsonb, 4, '4', 'Air swirling and rising — *air*, *energy*, the invisible force around us. qì ≈ "chee!" sharp. Tone 4 drops, like a gust hitting your face.', 'Udara yang berputar dan naik — *udara*, *energi*, kekuatan tak kasat mata di sekitar kita. qì ≈ "chi!" Nada 4 turun tajam, kayak embusan angin yang menghantam wajah.', null, null, null, array['[object Object]', '[object Object]']::text[], 2, array['weather', 'noun_part', 'beginner']::text[], true),
