  ('word_buyao', '不要', '不要', 'do not want / don''t', 'jangan / tidak mau', array['do not want / don''t']::text[], array['jangan / tidak mau']::text[], array[]::text[], array[]::text[], 'bú yào', 'bu2 yao4', '[{"hanzi":"不","text":"bú","tone":2},{"hanzi":"要","text":"yào","tone":4}]'::jsonb, '2-4', 'phrase', '不 not + 要 want — *don''t want* / *don''t* — a useful phrase for refusals.', '不 tidak + 要 mau — *tidak mau* / *jangan* — frasa berguna untuk penolakan.', null, null, '不要 = don''t want / don''t do it. A strong refusal.', '不要 = tidak mau / jangan lakukan. Penolakan yang tegas.', null, array['[object Object]']::text[], 6, array['health']::text[], true, true),
